    "body": "## Overview\n\nPass `quant_config` and `prefix` to the Qwen3.5 embedding layer, based on the [[original patch script](https://huggingface.co/ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-27B-3Bit-GSQ/blob/main/patch_vllm_qwen35_embedding.py)](https://huggingface.co/ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-27B-3Bit-GSQ/blob/main/patch_vllm_qwen35_embedding.py). Once merged, this fix will eliminate the need to manually patch vLLM to run the GSQ-quantized Qwen3.8-27B model.\n\n## Validation\n\nSuccessfully ran the GSQ-quantized Qwen3.8-27B model in Docker using vLLM v0.30.0 with the patch applied. Not yet tested on upstream `main`.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull Request Checklist</summary>\n\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Minimizes impact on core components, reuses existing functionality, and justifies added complexity.\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:** Validates the change and ensures any added tests are meaningful and reliable, with CI coverage or documented CI resource constraints and validation performed outside CI.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Keeps code and comments clear and concise; no documentation changes are needed for this focused fix.\n- [ ] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes a brief summary and relevant links, supports claims with evidence, explains root causes and implementation trade-offs, and follows the contributing guide.\n\n</details>\n\n",
